:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_9","text":"I do,indeed,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_10","text":"have something to,say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_11","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_12","text":"My poor,deduction skills,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_13","text":"caused,no small amount of,consternation for,everyone previously,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_14","text":"and for that,I apologize.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_15","text":"It was certainly,not intentional,on my part.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_16","text":"I will continue,to work on hard,on becoming,a better detective.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_17","text":"I'm sure you'll get better with time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_18","text":"You already apologized to us once before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_19","text":"This is all a bit unnecessary.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_20","text":"Nevertheless, we appreciate the gesture.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_21",