"speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_33","text":"I guess we didn't tell you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_34","text":"It's just that you were so into it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_35","text":"and you looked so happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_36","text":"We didn't tell you because we didn't want to spoil the fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_37","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_38","text":"Well, to be honest, it was pretty enjoyable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_39","text":"But the next day was a huge wash! I wasn't able to get up to any villainous activities.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_40","text":"I demand satisfaction!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_41","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_42","text":"I guess we don't have a choice, do we?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_43","text":"We'll have to lock you up in the prison cell for an hour.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_44","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_45","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_46","text":"Mwahahaha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_47","text":"I'm on my way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_48","text":"Halloween is the best!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_49","text":"Lol","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_50","text":"It sure is,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_51","text":"and it's all thanks to you guys.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_52","text":"I had a fun time as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_53","text":"It truly was a Halloween for the ages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_54","text":"In fact, once the holiday is over,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_55","text":"we should leave this chat room here as a memory.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_06_56","text":"Nice!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fr